    <li><strong>Privacy assessments are based on the published privacy policy and observed behavior</strong> (cookies, network requests). We didn't do formal forensic analysis.</li>
    <li><strong>No affiliate programs</strong> influenced this ranking. None of the listed tools have affiliate relationships with Helthvibe.</li>
    <li><strong>UX scoring is subjective.</strong> We tried to apply consistent criteria across all tools, but reasonable people will disagree on some calls.</li>
  </ul>

